         {
           on: 'task',
           title: 'captureScreenshot',
           func: (fileName, options = {}) => require('cypress-screenshot-utils').captureScreenshot(fileName, options)
         }
       ]
     }
   }
   ```

   Here, we enable Docker support (`experimentalDocker: true`), define the base folder for screenshots (`screenshotsFolder`), configure plugin files, and use the custom task from `cypress-screenshot-utils` to capture screenshots.

